{"type":"message","id":"ed2a2a3e","parentId":"562ac515","timestamp":"2026-05-19T05:11:12.844Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-64165422-4e17-4efd-a798-9968804bf169","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"code\":99991672,\"msg\":\"Access denied. One of the following scopes is required: [wiki:wiki, wiki:wiki:readonly, wiki:node:read].应用尚未开通所需的应用身份权限：[wiki:wiki, wiki:wiki:readonly, wiki:node:read]，点击链接申请并开通任一权限即可：https://open.feishu.cn/app/cli_aa8198b425389cef/auth?q=wiki:wiki,wiki:wiki:readonly,wiki:node:read&op_from=openapi&token_type=tenant\",\"error\":{\"message\":\"Refer to the documentation to fix the error: https://open.feishu.cn/document/uAjLw4CM/ugTN1YjL4UTN24CO1UjN/trouble-shooting/how-to-fix-the-99991672-error\",\"log_id\":\"20260519131112C8168B5C6B7C2C851FEA\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_id=20260519131112C8168B5C6B7C2C851FEA&code=99991672&method_id=7018092352167395329\",\"permission_violations\":[{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"wiki:wiki\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"wiki:wiki:readonly\"},{\"type\":\"action_scope_required\",\"subject\":\"wiki:node:read\"}]}}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":477,"aggregated":"{\"code\":99991672,\"msg\":\"Access denied. One of the following scopes is required: [wiki:wiki, wiki:wiki:readonly, wiki:node:read].应用尚未开通所需的应用身份权限：[wiki:wiki, wiki:wiki:readonly, wiki:node:read]，点击链接申请并开通任一权限即可：https://open.feishu.cn/app/cli_aa8198b425389cef/auth?q=wiki:wiki,wiki:wiki:readonly,wiki:node:read&op_from=openapi&token_type=tenant\",\"error\":{\"message\":\"Refer to the documentation to fix the error: https://open.feishu.cn/document/uAjLw4CM/ugTN1YjL4UTN24CO1UjN/trouble-shooting/how-to-fix-the-99991672-error\",\"log_id\":\"20260519131112C8168B5C6B7C2C851FEA\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_i