{"type":"message","id":"ba1731eb","parentId":"3ca084b4","timestamp":"2026-05-19T09:07:15.274Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the root block ID which is the same as the document ID. Let me add a heading block as a child.\n\nActually, for the Feishu docx API, blocks have types like:\n- 1 = page\n- 2 = heading1\n- 3 = heading2\n- etc.\n- 12 = text\n\nLet me add a heading and text block as children.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-3f657aa0-dbbf-49ef-9842-15d5be9cf6d1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/GX6PdAPdworxHlx4BFecp7FinZe/blocks/GX6PdAPdworxHlx4BFecp7FinZe/children\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g1045jh3ZRYUR2NDO3AFUWD4PQ3O3H4AGLIKWTF3\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"children\": [\n      {\n        \"block_type\": 2,\n        \"heading1\": {\n          \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"测试标题\", \"text_element_style\": {}}}],\n          \"style\": {}\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"block_type\": 12,\n        \"text\": {\n          \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"这是测试内容写入\", \"text_element_style\": {}}}],\n          \"style\": {}\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"index\": 0\n  }'","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":255,"output":346,"cacheRead":25808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26409,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779181602132,"responseId":"chatcmpl-55eadce3-0265-41cb-92d1-e72f11fc34ac"}}
