{"type":"message","id":"dd2f5dca","parentId":"d2e10e1e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T09:08:49.613Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Still failing. Let me check the Feishu API docs more carefully. The issue might be that for document blocks, we need the `document_revision_id` as a query parameter, not in the JSON body. Or maybe the format of the request is wrong.\n\nActually, wait - maybe I'm using the wrong API endpoint. Let me check the correct API endpoint format for adding blocks to a document.\n\nLooking at the Feishu docs: \n- POST `/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{document_id}/blocks/{block_id}/children`\n\nBut maybe the issue is the Content-Type or something else. Let me try with `page_size` as a query param.\n\n\nThe error code 1770001 means \"invalid param\" - the issue is likely that I need to pass `document_revision_id` as a query parameter to the children endpoint. Let me retry with the revision ID included in the URL instead.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-6152bc05-0bae-4453-981e-25c2ada533cb","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -v -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/GX6PdAPdworxHlx4BFecp7FinZe/blocks/GX6PdAPdworxHlx4BFecp7FinZe/children?document_revision_id=1\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer t-g1045jh3ZRYUR2NDO3AFUWD4PQ3O3H4AGLIKWTF3\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"children\": [\n      {\n        \"block_type\": 12,\n        \"text\": {\n          \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"测试内容\"}}],\n          \"style\": {}\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }' 2>&1 | tail -20","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":27210,"output":403,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27725,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779181686048,"resp