{"type":"message","id":"094a4d78","parentId":"bbd2f69e","timestamp":"2026-05-19T09:57:57.364Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they've already granted the permissions and asking me to test again. I need to test writing to the wiki document. I've already started testing - I can create documents and write blocks. Let me now test writing to the actual wiki document the user shared (MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc → doc DLi8duiTcoqOZIxixlucMSZ6ndf).\n\nI already confirmed:\n1. Wiki node access works ✅ (got the node info)\n2. Block creation in a new test document works ✅\n3. I can read the wiki doc ✅\n\nNow I need to actually write content to the wiki document. Let me write some test content to it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"权限已生效！现在完整测试链路——从 Wiki 节点到"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_65c9aa902f3b46e0916cb4d1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 1. 获取访问令牌\nTOKEN=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"app_id\": \"cli_aa8198b425389cef\", \"app_secret\": \"k0S58IdXo8doVPNlcaQEydgNpcGdPNOT\"}' | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin)['tenant_access_token'])\")\n\necho \"=== 1. 读取 Wiki 节点 ===\"\ncurl -s \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/wiki/v2/spaces/get_node?token=MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); n=d['data']['node']; print(f'标题: {n[\\\"title\\\"]}\\n文档ID: {n[\\\"obj_token\\\"]}\\n类型: {n[\\\"obj_type\\\"]}')\"\n\nDOC_ID=\"DLi8duiTcoqOZIxixlucMSZ6ndf\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 2. 清空旧内容 + 写入测试内容 ===\"\n\n# 先获取当前块列表\nBLOCKS=$(curl -s \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/$DOC_ID/blocks?document_revision_id=-1&page_size=50\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\")\necho \"当前块数: $(echo \"$BLOCKS\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print(len(json.load(sys.stdin)['data']['items']))\")\"\n\n# 获取修订版本号\nREV=$(echo \"$BLOCKS\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin)['data']['items'][0]['block_id'])\")\necho \"Root block ID: $REV\"\n\n# 写入测试内容 - 在页面根块下插入\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 3. 写入测试内容 ===\"\n\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/$DOC_ID/blocks/$DOC_ID/children\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"children\": [\n      {\"block_type\": 3, \"heading1\": {\"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"Talus 测试报告\"}}]}},\n      {\"block_type\": 2, \"text\": {\"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"这是在 Feishu Wiki 文档中由 Talus 写入的测试内容。\"}}]}},\n      {\"block_type\": 15, \"quote\": {\"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"通过 OpenClaw Feishu 工具写入 - 2026-05-19\"}}]}},\n      {\"block_type\": 22, \"divider\": {}},\n      {\"block_type\": 13, \"ordered\": {\"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"Wiki 节点访问 - ✅\"}}]}},\n      {\"block_type\": 13, \"ordered\": {\"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"文档读取 - ✅\"}}]}},\n      {\"block_type\": 13, \"ordered\": {\"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"文档写入 - ✅\"}}]}},\n      {\"block_type\": 13, \"ordered\": {\"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"Markdown 内容渲染 - ✅\"}}]}}\n    ],\n    \"index\": 0\n  }' | python3 -c \"import json,sys; d=json.load(sys.stdin); print('写入成功' if d['code']==0 else f'失败: {d}'); print(f'写入块数: {len(d.get(\\\"data\\\",{}).get(\\\"children\\\",[]))}')\"\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 4. 验证 - 读取最新内容 ===\"\ncurl -s \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/$DOC_ID/blocks?document_revision_id=-1&page_size=50\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" | python3 -c \"\nimport json,sys\ndata=json.load(sys.stdin)\nitems=data['data']['items']\nprint(f'文档标题: {items[0][\\\"page\\\"][\\\"elements\\\"][0][\\\"text_run\\\"][\\\"content\\\"]}')\nprint(f'总块数: {len(items)}')\nfor b in items[1:]:\n    typ={2:'Text',3:'H1',4:'H2',13:'Ordered',15:'Quote',22:'Divider'}.get(b['block_type'],str(b['block_type']))\n    content=''\n    if b.get('text'): content=b['text']['elements'][0]['text_run']['content']\n    elif b.get('heading1'): content=b['heading1']['elements'][0]['text_run']['content']\n    elif b.get('ordered'): content=b['ordered']['elements'][0]['text_run']['content']\n    elif b.get('quote'): content=b['quote']['elements'][0]['text_run']['content']\n    print(f'  [{typ}] {content}')\n\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779184433900,"responseId":"74883df6f9f94f0ba961176ce9f26d8e"}}
