{"type":"message","id":"a27e9e09","parentId":"6ea91134","timestamp":"2026-05-19T09:57:57.365Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The test was successful! I've demonstrated the full workflow:\n\n1. ✅ Wiki node access - successfully accessed the node\n2. ✅ Document reading - successfully read the document info and blocks\n3. ✅ Document writing - successfully wrote 8 blocks to the wiki document\n\nThe content was written to the wiki page \"agent 写入测试\". Now I need to tell the user the results.\n\nLooking at the output, the old blocks (PcUgdBaMfoTo0TxrugkcRZngnRc, HzlVdCgbhoS9Rtxtc7lcR4Dunqc with \"请继续输入：\" content) and my earlier test block (doxcnEJYbgpGF2kxABZJS8xOt8M with \"Talus测试写入\") are still there below my new content because I inserted at index 0. I should mention this to the user.\n\nActually, 12 blocks - 1 page block, 8 new blocks, and 3 old blocks. So there are 3 old blocks still there. The new content was inserted at the top.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"测试全部通过 ✅\n\nWiki 文档「agent 写入测试」已成功写入，内容如下：\n\n**Talus 测试报告**\n这是在 Feishu Wiki 文档中由 Talus 写入的测试内容。\n> 通过 OpenClaw Feishu 工具写入 - 2026-05-19\n---\n1. Wiki 节点访问 - ✅\n2. 文档读取 - ✅\n3. 文档写入 - ✅\n4. Markdown 内容渲染 - ✅\n\n**总结：所有功能正常工作**\n- Wiki 节点读取（`wiki:wiki`） ✅\n- 文档创建 ✅\n- 文档读取 ✅\n- 文档写入（多类型块：标题、文本、引用、分割线、有序列表） ✅\n\n之前文档里已有的旧内容还在下面，新内容插入在顶部。需要我清理掉旧内容重写一遍吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779184579539,"responseId":"4c3740ed6f464991b1ff204cb0ba60ab"}}
