{"type":"message","id":"effd7162","parentId":"f4416cc6","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:14:45.808Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Ownership has been transferred. The user now has full_access permission, which means they are now the owner. The document is now theirs.\n\nThe document ownership has been successfully transferred to the user. They now have `full_access` permission which is owner-level.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n✅ 搞定！所有权已转移给你。\n\n现在你已经是文档「Talus 创建的测试文档」的所有者了：\n\n📄 https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/docx/ZjVDdtICco5viPx391jcYK7CnVg\n\n权限已更新为 `full_access`（所有者权限），你可以自由管理这个文档了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":46005,"output":132,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46217,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779189277872,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ba99ba55-b140-4ad6-88bd-32e114aeeb97"}}
