{"type":"message","id":"5a485e8a","parentId":"3ad9c4d7","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:14:45.895Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try without the trailing slash and with different variations. Actually, let me look at the Feishu documentation to find the correct API endpoint for transferring document ownership.\n\nActually, the transfer owner API might be:\n- `POST /drive/v1/permissions/{token}/transfer_owner?type={type}`\n\nBut I'm getting 404. Maybe the API is different. Let me try:\n1. Maybe the endpoint needs to be `transfer_owner` without a trailing slash in the path\n2. Maybe the API version is different\n\nLet me also try looking at it from the perspective of the permission API and see if there's a different way to set ownership.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-5e2f6c67-92f8-478d-b075-8d1978c6cb9c","name":"exec","arguments":{"timeout":10,"command":"TOKEN=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"app_id\": \"cli_aa8198b425389cef\", \"app_secret\": \"k0S58IdXo8doVPNlcaQEydgNpcGdPNOT\"}' | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin)['tenant_access_token'])\")\n\n# 试试直接PATCH权限为full_access\ncurl -s -X PATCH \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/permissions/ZjVDdtICco5viPx391jcYK7CnVg/members?type=docx\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"member_type\": \"openid\",\n    \"member_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n    \"perm\": \"full_access\"\n  }'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":42659,"output":408,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43179,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779189140751,"responseId"