{"type":"message","id":"1fda7e1e","parentId":"d94d5c70","timestamp":"2026-05-19T11:14:45.895Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The `docx` endpoint for transfer owner also returns 404. Let me try another approach - the transfer owner might be under a different API path. Looking at Feishu's docs, it might be under `/drive/v1/permissions/{token}/members/transfer_owner` or similar.\n\nActually, let me just try using the APIExplorer approach or look at what error code we're getting more specifically. The transfer owner API might not be available for docx type.\n\nLet me try the doc type instead (the old document type):\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-d79f2ff5-ef19-4a04-aea7-b243b3a10e02","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"TOKEN=$(curl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"app_id\": \"cli_aa8198b425389cef\", \"app_secret\": \"k0S58IdXo8doVPNlcaQEydgNpcGdPNOT\"}' | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin)['tenant_access_token'])\")\n\n# 试试用旧版 doc 类型\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/drive/v1/permissions/ZjVDdtICco5viPx391jcYK7CnVg/transfer_owner?type=doc\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"member_type\": \"openid\",\n    \"member_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n  }'","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":43949,"output":372,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44433,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779189192134,"responseId":"chatcmpl-74179c52-cd9c-4c75-aa9e-2803bc90e0ff"}}
